    + [84, 176].map(cx => g(sk(`<rect x="${cx - 8}" y="210" width="16" height="10" rx="2" style="fill:#7A5A3E"/><path d="M${cx - 8} 210 v-14 q8 -6 16 0 v14" style="fill:none;stroke:#7A5A3E" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M${cx - 6} 220 v18 M${cx + 6} 220 v18" style="stroke:#7A5A3E" stroke-width="2.4"/>`, `<rect x="${cx - 8}" y="210" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/>`))).join("");
